---
description: UI component rules
globs: ["components/**/*.tsx", "app/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Build reusable components when appropriate:
- Section
- Container
- Button
- EventDetailCard
- RSVPButton
- Gallery
- TimelineItem
- LocationSection

Component rules:
- Use TypeScript
- Use semantic HTML
- Keep components small and readable
- Prefer composition over large monolithic files
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Avoid inline styles unless absolutely necessary
- Do not hardcode repeated values across many components if they should become design tokens

Accessibility:
- Maintain strong color contrast
- Use readable font sizes
- Buttons and links must have clear labels
- Images must have meaningful alt text
- Interactive elements must be keyboard accessible

Mobile:
- Design mobile-first
- Avoid tiny text
- Avoid cramped layouts
- RSVP button should be easy to tap